{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24844","headline":"寄赠田仓曹湾 · 杨衡","name":"寄赠田仓曹湾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳兰媚庭除，灼灼红英舒。\n身爲陋巷客，门有绦辕车。\n朝览夷胡传，暮习颍阳书。\n盻云高羽翼，待贾蕴璠璵。\n缨弁虽云阻，音尘岂复疎。\n若因风雨晦，应念寂寥居。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24844.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24844","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}